Third-party material in the baud-render crate

The licence of baud-render is LICENSE. This file lists the material from
other projects that files in this crate carry: for each, the files by their
paths in this crate, the licence it keeps, and where the notice that licence
asks for is. It is generated from docs/research/third-party.toml in baud's
repository, whose THIRD_PARTY.md lists every such file in the repository.

